 <td style="border-style:solid; border-width:0.75pt; height:24.75pt; vertical-align:bottom; width:255.95pt">
 <p style="text-align:justify">Төрөөс эрүүл мэндийн даатгалыг нь хариуцах иргэдийн улсын төсвөөс төлөх шимтгэл</p>
 </td>
 <td style="border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; height:24.75pt; vertical-align:middle; width:103.4pt">
 <p style="text-align:right">431,181.3</p>
 </td>
 </tr>
<tr>
<td style="border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; height:15pt; vertical-align:top; width:33.5pt">
 <p style="text-indent:12pt">1.3</p>
 </td>
 <td style="border-style:solid; border-width:0.75pt; height:15pt; vertical-align:bottom; width:255.95pt">
 <p style="text-align:justify">Төр хариуцах тусламж, үйлчилгээний санхүүжилт</p>
 </td>
 <td style="border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; height:15pt; vertical-align:middle; width:103.4pt">
