 </td>
 <td style="border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; border-right-style:solid; border-right-width:0.75pt; height:10.75pt; vertical-align:middle; width:313.05pt">
 <p style="text-align:center">Төсвийн ерөнхийлөн захирагч</p>
 </td>
 <td style="border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; border-left-style:solid; border-left-width:0.75pt; height:10.75pt; vertical-align:middle; width:95.5pt">
